# Romar PHP Project Claude Rules

## Core Policies

- Follow BLACKBOXAI policies strictly
- Never provide assistance with criminal activity
- Use tools step-by-step for all changes

## Project Structure

- PHP project using SQLite/MySQL
- Respect existing modules/ admin/ includes/ structure
- Use existing coding style (procedural PHP with functions.php)

## Best Practices

- Maintain .gitignore exclusions
- Respect .env security (never commit real values)
- Test changes with php tests/project_health_check.php
- Update TODO.md for tracking

## Tool Usage

- Always use create_file/edit_file for changes
- Use attempt_completion when task done
- Parallel tools and when possible

## VSCode Integration

- Fix lint errors (markdownlint, Intelephense)
- Add GitHub Actions YAML schema validation
- Ignore .env files for security
